**frame.cpp does diagnostic formatting for `input_frame`.**

## Interface

`operator<<(ostream&, const input_frame&) -> ostream&` emits `device family #sequence`, appending `latency` milliseconds when `timing.consumed != timestamp{}`.

## Dependencies

`chrono::duration_cast<milliseconds>` formats `timing.latency()`.